'7.4':{e:'For X with values 0,1,2 and probabilities .2,.5,.3, find E(X).',s:['Multiply each value by its probability.','0(.2)+1(.5)+2(.3)=0+.5+.6.','Expected value is 1.1.'],w:'Expected value is a probability-weighted long-run average, not necessarily a possible single outcome.',t:'For values 1,2,3 with probabilities .3,.4,.3, find E(X).',a:'2'},
'7.5':{e:'A normal distribution has mean 70 and standard deviation 5. Estimate the interval containing about 68%.',s:['The 68% rule uses one standard deviation from the mean.','Lower:70-5=65; upper:70+5=75.','About 68% lies between 65 and 75.'],w:'Normal distributions have predictable percentages within one, two, and three standard deviations.',t:'Mean 100, standard deviation 12: estimate the central 95% interval.',a:'76 to 124'},
'7.6':{e:'A poll estimates 46% support with margin of error 2%.',s:['Subtract 2 percentage points:44%.','Add 2 percentage points:48%.','The plausible interval is 44% to 48%.'],w:'An interval communicates uncertainty more honestly than a single sample percentage.',t:'Estimate 58% with margin of error 3%. Give the interval.',a:'55% to 61%'},
'8.1':{e:'Rotate a rectangle 3 units by 5 units around its 5-unit side.',s:['The rotation creates a cylinder.','Radius is 3 and height is 5.','Volume is pi(3^2)(5)=45pi cubic units.'],w:'Every point sweeps a circle around the axis, turning the rectangle into a cylinder.',t:'Rotate a 2-by-7 rectangle around its 7-unit side. Find the solid and volume.',a:'Cylinder; 28pi cubic units'},
'8.2':{e:'A metal sample has mass 540 g and volume 60 cm^3.',s:['Use density=mass/volume.','540/60=9.','Density is 9 g/cm^3.'],w:'Dividing by volume reports how much mass is packed into each cubic unit.',t:'Find density for mass 315 g and volume 45 cm^3.',a:'7 g/cm^3'},
'8.3':{e:'Find the area of a triangle with sides 8 and 11 and included angle 35 degrees.',s:['Use A=(1/2)ab sin(C).','A=(1/2)(8)(11)sin35 degrees.','A≈25.24 square units.'],w:'The sine gives the perpendicular height component when two sides and their included angle are known.',t:'Find the area with sides 6 and 13 and included angle 50 degrees.',a:'About 29.88 square units'},
