'9.2':{e:'Find sin(210 degrees) and cos(210 degrees).',s:['Reference angle is 30 degrees.','210 degrees is in Quadrant III, where sine and cosine are negative.','sin=-1/2 and cos=-sqrt(3)/2.'],w:'Reference angles give magnitudes; the quadrant determines signs.',t:'Find sin(330 degrees) and cos(330 degrees).',a:'sin=-1/2, cos=sqrt(3)/2'},
